# vocabulary-service - deploy/env/vocabulary.env (copy from this file; never commit the real one).
# Only what vocabulary-service reads at runtime and compose does NOT set. Compose already sets the wiring
# (ports, DATABASE_URL, REDIS_*, RABBITMQ_URL, *_GRPC_URL, JWT_*, SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET) from deploy/.env.
# Empty KEY= lines are required values; commented lines are optional tunables with their default.

# Nothing secret: Redis, r2/ai gRPC URLs, R2_PUBLIC_URL and the service token are wired by compose.
# vocabulary publishes and consumes no events, so there is no RabbitMQ user either.
